          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>During our family's healthy-ingredients journey, the customer who came back to us most often was the one whose skin reacts to everything — fragrance, parabens, dimethicone, mineral oil. We built every formula from there.<\/p><p>The reason we put this reset together is simple: skin doesn't change in a week. It takes about 90 days of consistent, clean moisture to actually turn a corner. This box gives you exactly that — three lotions and a cream — so you never run out halfway through.<\/p><p>— Sean Fillmore<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        }
      },
